` the instruments that a melody can be played on. every one of them has a sound for every note.
` the bell is a clear ring. it is good for slow tunes with room in them.
` the pluck is a plucked string, like a harp. it is good for quick runs of notes.
` the swell is a soft tone that fades in. it takes a second to arrive, so it is only good for slow tunes.
#constant INSTRUMENT_BELL 0
#constant INSTRUMENT_PLUCK 1
#constant INSTRUMENT_SWELL 2
